                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6599054-a5db-4a0c-ac7f-cf4669533833",
                                                "sense_id": "23522888-5491-3c44-8957-299b59f0fc72",
                                                "text": "MATT DARRIAU’S PARADOX TRIO (Thursday) In addition to Mr. Darriau — on clarinet and saxophones as well as kaval (an end-blown flute) and gaida (a kind of bagpipe) — this exuberant Bulgarian-improv band features Brad Shepik’s guitars, Rufus Cappadocia’s cello and Seido Salifoski’s hand drums."
                                            }
